      "text": "This is the prosecution of accused Sandeep pursuant to charge sheet filed by Police Station Malviya Nagar U/s 498A/304B Indian Penal Code (hereinafter referred to as IPC) subsequent to the investigation carried out by it in FIR No. 270/23.\n2.",
