      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16986709833145142
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "On 21.06.2023 at about 05.00 AM sister in law of Neha namely Asha called the elder sister of Neha who was at her parental house at that time and stated that Neha has hanged her and has been shifted to Pandit Madan Mohan Malviya Hospital.",
