      "text": "PW1 further deposed that on 21.06.2023, he got the information that his daughter had committed suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4325,
      "end": 4428,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21.06.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4353,
          "end": 4363
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16928620636463165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "PW1 further deposed that on hearing this, he came to Delhi and postmortem of his daughter was conducted and dead body was handed over to him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4429,
      "end": 4570,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Delhi",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4482,
          "end": 4487
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03487300127744675
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "PW1 exhibited on record his complaint recorded by Executive Magistrate as Ex. PW1/A. As this witness did not support the case of prosecution in its entirety, he was cross examined by Ld.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4571,
      "end": 4757,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09827166795730591
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Additional PP for the state with the permission of the court and on behalf of accused as well.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4758,
      "end": 4852,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.05166061222553253
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "9. PW2 Sh. Satbir deposed that Gyan Chand i.e. PW1 is his brother.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4854,
      "end": 4920,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Satbir",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 4865,
          "end": 4871
        },
        {
          "text": "Gyan Chand",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 4885,
          "end": 4895
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03330616652965546
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "PW2 deposed on the same lines as that of PW1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4921,
      "end": 4966,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03009750507771969
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "Statement of PW2 is Ex. PW2/A.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4967,
      "end": 4997,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.040934909135103226
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "As this witness did not support the case of prosecution in its entirety, he was also cross examined by Ld.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4998,
      "end": 5104,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03140711039304733
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Additional PP for the state with the permission of the court and on behalf of accused as well.\nState vs Sandeep And Anr on 14 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/173180640/\n2 10.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 5105,
      "end": 5304,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "State vs Sandeep And Anr",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 5200,
          "end": 5224
        },
        {
          "text": "14 August, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5228,
          "end": 5243
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04471508413553238
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "During trial statement u/s 294 Cr.P.C. of accused was recorded where he has admitted the scaled site plan as Ex. A1, MLC of deceased Neha bearing no. 4388 dated 21.06.2023 as Ex. A2, post mortem report no. 710-2023 as Ex. A3 and RFSL report no. RFSL / DLH / 594 / CHEM / 331/23 dated 06.11.2023 as Ex. A4.\n11.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 5305,
      "end": 5614,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "s 294",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 5330,
          "end": 5335
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 5336,
          "end": 5343
        },
        {
          "text": "Neha",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 5438,
          "end": 5442
        },
        {
          "text": "21.06.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5466,
          "end": 5476
        },
        {
          "text": "RFSL",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 5534,
          "end": 5538
        },
        {
          "text": "06.11.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5589,
          "end": 5599
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.043679047375917435
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "As both the material witnesses failed to support the case of the prosecution and turned hostile,\ntherefore Ld. Additional Public Prosecutor for the state, made submissions to drop all the remaining witnesses as the prosecution did not wish to examine them as it would have been a futile exercies.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 5615,
      "end": 5911,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1633230596780777
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "In view of the submissions made by the Ld. Additional PP for the state, PE was closed vide order dated 31.07.2024.\n12.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 5912,
      "end": 6030,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.07.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 6015,
          "end": 6025
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09652720391750336
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "As no incriminating circumstances appeared in evidence against the accused, recording of statement of accused u/s 313 Cr.P.C. was dispensed with.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 6031,
      "end": 6176,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "s 313",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 6143,
          "end": 6148
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 6149,
          "end": 6156
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.154994934797287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "13. Both the star witnesses of the prosecution i.e. PW1 Gyan Chand and PW2 Sh. Satbir have failed to support the case of the prosecution in any manner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6178,
      "end": 6329,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gyan Chand",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 6234,
          "end": 6244
        },
        {
          "text": "Satbir",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 6257,
          "end": 6263
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27031081914901733
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "Both the witnesses were cross examined by Ld.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 6330,
      "end": 6375,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "Additional PP for the state and even during their cross examination both the aforesaid witnesses failed to substantiate the case of the prosecution and categorically denied the facts allegedly stated by them in their previous respective statements.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6376,
      "end": 6624,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3063387870788574
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "Both the witnesses were cross examined on behalf of the accused as well.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6625,
      "end": 6697,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35111182928085327
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "During their cross examination, both the aforesaid witnesses admitted that the deceased never complained with respect to demand of dowry by the accused at any point of time after the marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6698,
      "end": 6890,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4489732086658478
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "As such the deposition of material witnesses PW1 and PW2 is of no help to the case of the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6891,
      "end": 6993,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.45795702934265137
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "14. There is no independent public witness examined by the prosecution to establish its case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6994,
      "end": 7088,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.574748694896698
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "There is not even iota of evidence adduced on record attributing the culpability of the accused in this case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7089,
      "end": 7198,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4903852641582489
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 53,
      "text": "In absence of any cogent evidence lead on record by the prosecution, it can safely be concluded that the prosecution has failed to prove the guilt of the accused for the offences charged against him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7199,
      "end": 7399,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6029043793678284
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 54,
      "text": "Accordingly, accused Sandeep stands acquitted of the charges levelled against him in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7401,
      "end": 7504,
      "entities": [
